    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d81b93b9a8d0121b1afedb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 08:34:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📚本期请到“看理想劳模"“时间管理大师”杨照老师！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「vistopia录音室」和杨照老师聊了聊金庸小说中对权力、爱情观、女性形象的描写，以及作品的影视化改编。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎查看收听看理想App杨照主讲《曾经江湖：重读金庸》</span></p><span></span><p><span>收看指南⚔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 热烈欢迎杨照老师！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 《笑傲江湖》有哪些对权力崇拜的暗喻？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> 古代皇帝多数受儒家思想影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 从小龙女到梅超风，金庸笔下的女性角色更有魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 当我们用现代人的眼光读武侠小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 金庸最擅长描写“偏执”的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 为什么我们喜欢亦正亦邪的角色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2743">45:43</a> 金庸作品中的女性虽然主动，但行动还是围绕男性角色展开？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 影视改编和文学原著，完全是两码事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a> 为什么说梁朝伟演不好韦小宝？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAFH39MMREb15Mza_WDrHsN_i9Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎤 本期主播：杨照、dy、jiarui</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂️ 制作：叶叶子、think</span></p><span></span><p><span>🖼 设计：大夹子、耳塞、火车头、唐醋排骨</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏🏻「vistopia录音室」是看理想全新推出的视频播客，完整视频可在看理想App、bilibili看理想vistopia账号收看。</span></p>]]></description>
