  <item>
    <title>vol.08 中国人的死亡质量为什么比较差？with景军、宋敏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d81aa7a1ceb50015aa2bac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d81aa7a1ceb50015aa2bac</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 08:30:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🏥本集继续跟清华大学社会学系教授景军，聊聊关于死亡、临终照护与反向关怀的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在看理想App查看景军主讲《谈病说痛：当代医疗生态的反思与追问》</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指南💊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 开场介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 苦难和死亡，是景军老师一直研究和思考的主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 中国人的死亡质量，为什么比较差？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 一个人活成什么样，就会死成什么样子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> 什么是临终反向关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a> 反向关怀让死亡有了意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> 是家人，也是“凶手”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> 如何更好地面对亲人离世的痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a> 努力想象一个更好的社会</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqYHNSLesVRETmZZOhFx0x1M3NIl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎤 本期主播：景军、宋敏、jiarui</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂️ 制作：叶叶子、think</span></p><span></span><p><span>🖼 设计：大夹子、耳塞、火车头、唐醋排骨</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏🏻「vistopia录音室」是看理想全新推出的视频播客，完整视频可在看理想App、bilibili看理想vistopia账号收看。</span></p>]]></description>
