    <title>vol.03《不够善良的我们》在讲什么？| with 於嘉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667a7622d7581fd2d748c7f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667a7622d7581fd2d748c7f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jun 2024 07:47:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📺台剧next level选手《不够善良的我们》高开低走，从豆瓣9.0一路跌到8.3分。 它到底是女性剧新高度，还是刻板的旧故事？本期我们邀请於嘉老师做客录音室，一起聊聊这部2024上半年最🔥台剧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收看指南👫🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> 欢迎於嘉老师做客录音室！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 你喜欢《不够善良的我们》这部剧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 40岁，可能是人生最痛苦的阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 未选择的那条路，不一定会更好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 社会规范会无时无刻不在影响着你的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 东亚小孩有“发疯”的自由吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:01</a> 学习了“薛定谔的猫”，就能用它来指导我生活吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> 简庆芬和Rebecca之间存在“女性友谊”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 人类的本质就是“爱比较”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">35:57</a> “完美男性”何瑞之</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 中国有多少家庭的父亲，是孩子的主要照料者？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2751">45:51</a> 当代年轻女性为何极度排斥结婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a> Rebecca结局意难平？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3303">55:03</a> 女性为什么不能同时拥有“事业和家庭”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3608">1:00:08</a> 娜拉出走后，能走到哪儿去？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4033">1:07:13</a> 几个应对催婚催育的小窍门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4276">1:11:16</a> 不要为了讨好他人，而失去自我</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤 本期主播：於嘉、jiarui、dy</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂️ 制作：叶叶子、think</span></p><span></span><p><span>🖼 设计：大夹子、耳塞、火车头、唐醋排骨</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏🏻「vistopia录音室」是看理想全新推出的视频播客，完整视频可在看理想App、bilibili看理想vistopia账号收看。</span></p>]]></description>
